{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01379",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 6.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Ah, doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.67,
      "end_seconds": 13.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "So, you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.48,
      "end_seconds": 24.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Mainly sharp pain when I breathe in. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.02,
      "end_seconds": 32.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.4,
      "end_seconds": 36.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Ever since... since Friday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.95,
      "end_seconds": 42.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.0,
      "end_seconds": 75.13,
      "duration_seconds": 30.13,
      "text": "A eight out of ten, I suppose. It happens once or twice a day. It's worse with deep breaths. Uh, and a swollen painful calf as well, since Friday. As for coughing up a little blood, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.83,
      "end_seconds": 79.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.02,
      "end_seconds": 93.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.29,
      "end_seconds": 120.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "okay: temp 37.6 degrees, pressure 121 over 83, heart rate 84, oxygen saturation is 91 percent, respiratory rate 25."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.08,
      "end_seconds": 124.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.18,
      "end_seconds": 134.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.35,
      "end_seconds": 137.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.57,
      "end_seconds": 161.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Your left calf is swollen and tender, and your oxygen is lower than I'd like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.04,
      "end_seconds": 163.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.72,
      "end_seconds": 170.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.58,
      "end_seconds": 186.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "let me check a few things any fever, wheeze or chest tightness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.5,
      "end_seconds": 192.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "No, no fever, wheeze or chest tightness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.84,
      "end_seconds": 196.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.79,
      "end_seconds": 201.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.7,
      "end_seconds": 209.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.89,
      "end_seconds": 214.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "It's allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.17,
      "end_seconds": 218.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.6,
      "end_seconds": 225.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Just two stents put in my heart, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.44,
      "end_seconds": 248.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past? These questions might sound routine, but they matter"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.82,
      "end_seconds": 253.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I've got gout. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.39,
      "end_seconds": 261.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Yes. Okay, I can see gout in your file as well. Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.97,
      "end_seconds": 264.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "yes, wheat i get bloating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.72,
      "end_seconds": 267.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.41,
      "end_seconds": 272.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.77,
      "end_seconds": 276.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Okay, what's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.87,
      "end_seconds": 282.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.14,
      "end_seconds": 286.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "so, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.07,
      "end_seconds": 290.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.18,
      "end_seconds": 299.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a possible blood clot in the lung"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.76,
      "end_seconds": 303.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "yeah, will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.36,
      "end_seconds": 323.49,
      "duration_seconds": 19.13,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a possible blood clot in the lung, and we'll know more once the a CT scan of the chest is back i think a CT scan of the chest makes sense here, for breathlessness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 324.86,
      "end_seconds": 328.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 10 am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.87,
      "end_seconds": 341.79,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a D-dimer blood test for possible clot. You need to go to hospital now for a scan. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.31,
      "end_seconds": 344.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.17,
      "end_seconds": 347.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "take care now"
    }
  ]
}